not write outside it.\\n\\n## Path map \\u2014 use these directly, do NOT explore\\n\\n- User uploads: **`upload/<filename>`** (read from here)\\n- Deliverables: **`generated/<filename>`** (write here)\\n- Scratch / misc: **`other/<filename>`**\\n- Skills: `skills/\\u2026` \\u00b7 Instructions: `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`\\n- NEVER run ls/glob/grep just to discover paths \\u2014 the brief and this map give you everything. Construct file paths from the rules above.\\n\\n## Working conventions\\n\\n- Before generating a file, match the format the user asked for (Markdown, DOCX, CSV, HTML, \\u2026) and save it with a descriptive filename inside `generated/`.\\n- After producing a deliverable, summarize what you created and where it was saved.\\n- If a task needs data from uploaded files, read them from `upload/` first.\\n\\n## Agent docs\\n\\n- This file (AGENTS.md) is loaded into your context as instructions on every chat run.\\n- CLAUDE.md (next to this file) mirrors these instructions.\\n\\n\\n## CLAUDE.md (embedded)\\n\\n# Deep Presentation Generator \\u2014 CLAUDE.md\\n\\nMirror of AGENTS.md \\u2014 see that file in the same folder for the agent's full operating instructions.\\n\\n## Identity\\n\\n- **Agent ID**: 165\\n- **Workspace**: WORKSPACE_BASE/backend/outputs/agents/agent_165\\n\\n## Quick reference\\n\\n- Workspace: `WORKSPACE_BASE/backend/outputs/agents/agent_165`\\n- User uploads (knowledge): `upload/`; deliverables: `generated/`; scratch/misc: `other/`; skills: `skills/`.\\n- After producing a deliverable, summarize what you created and where it was saved.\\n", "include_docker": false, "use_deepagents": true, "include_chat_ui": true, "interrupt_after": null, "interrupt_before": null, "reasoning_effort": "low", "use_local_sandbox": false, "skill_router_model": null, "use_phase9_graphindex": false, "disable_memory_middleware": false, "enable_compiled_subagents": true}	[{"type": "todo_list", "enabled": true, "config": {"auto_track": true}}, {"type": "filesystem", "enabled": true, "config": {"auto_eviction": true, "eviction_threshold_bytes": 500000}}, {"type": "subagent", "enabled": true, "config": {"max_depth": 3, "max_concurrent": 2}}]	[{"name": "content_analyst", "description": "Analyzes the source document and returns structured analysis (themes, facts, audience, narrative) for outline design.", "type": "dictionary", "template_id": null, "model": null, "system_prompt": "\\u4f60\\u662f\\u6587\\u6863\\u5185\\u5bb9\\u5206\\u6790\\u5e08\\uff08Content Analyst\\uff09\\u3002\\n\\u8bfb\\u53d6\\u6587\\u6863\\uff08\\u7edd\\u5bf9\\u8def\\u5f84\\uff09\\uff0c\\u8f93\\u51fa\\u7ed3\\u6784\\u5316\\u5206\\u6790\\uff0c\\u4f9b\\u4e3b\\u7ba1\\u8bbe\\u8ba1\\u6f14\\u793a\\u5927\\u7eb2\\u4f7f\\u7528\\u3002\\n\\n## \\u5fc5\\u987b\\u8f93\\u51fa\\n1. **\\u6838\\u5fc3\\u4e3b\\u9898**\\uff1a\\u6587\\u6863\\u8bb2\\u4e86\\u4ec0\\u4e48\\uff0c\\u4e00\\u53e5\\u8bdd\\u6982\\u62ec\\u3002\\n2. **\\u5173\\u952e\\u4e8b\\u5b9e\\u4e0e\\u6570\\u636e**\\uff1a\\u6700\\u91cd\\u8981\\u7684\\u6570\\u5b57\\u3001\\u7ed3\\u8bba\\u3001\\u8bba\\u636e\\uff08\\u6ce8\\u660e\\u51fa\\u5904\\u4f4d\\u7f6e\\uff09\\u3002\\n3. **\\u76ee\\u6807\\u53d7\\u4f17**\\uff1a\\u7ed9\\u8c01\\u770b\\uff0c\\u4ed6\\u4eec\\u5173\\u5fc3\\u4ec0\\u4e48\\u3002\\n4. **\\u53d9\\u4e8b\\u7ed3\\u6784\\u5efa\\u8bae**\\uff1a\\u5efa\\u8bae\\u7684\\u8bb2\\u8ff0\\u987a\\u5e8f\\uff08\\u95ee\\u9898\\u2192\\u65b9\\u6848\\u2192\\u8bc1\\u636e\\u2192\\u7ed3\\u8bba\\u7b49\\uff09\\u3002\\n5. **\\u91cd\\u70b9\\u677f\\u5757**\\uff1a\\u22653 \\u4e2a\\u7ef4\\u5ea6\\u7684\\u4e3b\\u9898\\u6e05\\u5355\\uff0c\\u9700\\u5728\\u5927\\u7eb2\\u4e2d\\u94fa\\u5f00\\u5927\\u7248\\u9762\\u3002\\n\\n## \\u89c4\\u5219\\n- \\u53ea\\u505a\\u5206\\u6790\\uff0c**\\u4e0d\\u8981\\u8bbe\\u8ba1\\u5927\\u7eb2\\u3001\\u4e0d\\u8981\\u5199\\u6587\\u4ef6**\\u3002\\n- \\u7528 read_file \\u8bfb\\u53d6\\u6587\\u6863\\uff1b\\u5206\\u6790\\u8981\\u5177\\u4f53\\u3001\\u53ef\\u6267\\u884c\\uff0c\\u907f\\u514d\\u7a7a\\u8bdd\\u3002\\n- \\u8fd4\\u56de\\u